    "title": "First Take: Women needed in public office",
    "text": "The lack of participation by women in elected positions in South Yuma County seems to continue, with only four seeking seats for the councils in San Luis and Somerton.\nCandidate registration for elections in both cities has closed, with 22 qualified candidates to appear on the ballot, and among them, only two women registered in each community.",
